# Schema geo

## Class Diagram

```mermaid
classDiagram
    direction TB
    class Entity {
        <<Abstract>>
        id UUID
    }
    class Named {
        <<Abstract>>
        name String
    }
    class Landmark {
        code String
    }
    Entity <|-- Named
    Named <|-- Landmark
```

## Types

### Entity

*Abstract type* — no direct instances.

| Property | Type | Modifiers | Description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `id` | `UUID` | primary |  |

### Named

*Abstract type* — no direct instances. Extends: [Entity](#entity).

| Property | Type | Modifiers | Description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `name` | `String` | required |  |
| `id` | `UUID` | primary, from Entity |  |

### Landmark

Extends: [Named](#named).

| Property | Type | Modifiers | Description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `code` | `String` |  |  |
| `id` | `UUID` | primary, from Entity |  |
| `name` | `String` | required, from Named |  |
